    12.4 mA. Connection pair Battery_positive and Battery_negative.\nGeneral teaching
    principle: Electrical measurements are differences or flows that require a correct
    reference, operating condition and fresh solver evidence.\nOnly fresh, authoritative
    game evidence can establish that this objective is complete."
